WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Why it helps. When thoughts race, your senses bring you back to the room.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.000
5 things you see. Look around slowly. Name five things, out loud or in your head.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
4 things you feel. Your feet on the floor. Your clothes. The chair. Something you can touch.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
3 things you hear. Near sounds. Far sounds. Your own breathing.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:33.000
2 things you smell. Or remember two smells you like.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:40.000
1 thing you taste. Or take one slow, deep breath.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Well done. Repeat any time. Talk to someone you trust if it stays hard.

